1
00:00:02,136 --> 00:00:03,416
After the gates close,

2
00:00:03,436 --> 00:00:04,801
there's one more story,

3
00:00:04,821 --> 00:00:06,996
called The Sins of Our Fathers.

4
00:00:07,076 --> 00:00:08,556
It belongs to Filip,

5
00:00:08,576 --> 00:00:10,856
the son of Naomi and Marco,

6
00:00:10,876 --> 00:00:13,856
the boy who helped drop rocks on Earth.

7
00:00:13,876 --> 00:00:15,581
Now he's a grown man on one

8
00:00:15,601 --> 00:00:17,076
of those cut off worlds,

9
00:00:17,096 --> 00:00:18,876
trying to be someone else.

10
00:00:18,896 --> 00:00:20,227
Spoilers ahead!

11
00:00:20,967 --> 00:00:22,433
Filip lives on Jannah,

12
00:00:22,453 --> 00:00:24,497
a young colony world,

13
00:00:24,517 --> 00:00:25,547
in a small settlement

14
00:00:25,567 --> 00:00:27,347
of a few hundred people.

15
00:00:27,367 --> 00:00:29,137
He goes by his mother's name,

16
00:00:29,157 --> 00:00:31,452
Nagata, and nobody there knows

17
00:00:31,472 --> 00:00:32,677
what he did.

18
00:00:32,697 --> 00:00:33,877
The gates are gone,

19
00:00:33,897 --> 00:00:35,697
and no help is coming.

20
00:00:35,817 --> 00:00:37,647
Supplies are running low,

21
00:00:37,667 --> 00:00:40,630
and every broken part is hard to replace.

22
00:00:41,329 --> 00:00:42,734
Then the creatures come:

23
00:00:42,754 --> 00:00:44,474
huge animals on the move,

24
00:00:44,494 --> 00:00:46,824
tearing through anything in their path.

25
00:00:46,844 --> 00:00:49,474
The settlement's defenses may not hold.

26
00:00:49,494 --> 00:00:51,224
The colonists vote to pack up

27
00:00:51,244 --> 00:00:53,119
and move somewhere safer.

28
00:00:53,219 --> 00:00:56,549
But Jandro, the chief of maintenance, refuses.

29
00:00:56,569 --> 00:00:58,224
He fortifies the town,

30
00:00:58,244 --> 00:00:59,404
ignores the vote,

31
00:00:59,424 --> 00:01:00,954
and takes control.

32
00:01:00,974 --> 00:01:02,029
People are scared,

33
00:01:02,049 --> 00:01:03,632
and they start to obey him.

34
00:01:04,342 --> 00:01:06,197
Filip has seen this before.

35
00:01:06,217 --> 00:01:07,542
Jandro is strong,

36
00:01:07,562 --> 00:01:09,042
angry, and sure he's right,

37
00:01:09,062 --> 00:01:10,612
just like Marco.

38
00:01:10,732 --> 00:01:12,672
Filip once followed a man like that,

39
00:01:12,692 --> 00:01:14,547
and Earth paid the price.

40
00:01:14,567 --> 00:01:16,147
This time he stops it.

41
00:01:16,167 --> 00:01:17,647
He kills Jandro.

42
00:01:17,667 --> 00:01:20,792
Then the colony sends him away, into exile.

43
00:01:20,817 --> 00:01:22,312
He can't undo his past,

44
00:01:22,332 --> 00:01:23,537
but this time he used it

45
00:01:23,557 --> 00:01:24,756
to protect people.

46
00:01:25,512 --> 00:01:27,542
And then, the very end.

47
00:01:27,562 --> 00:01:29,367
A thousand years pass.

48
00:01:29,387 --> 00:01:31,302
The scattered worlds grow apart,

49
00:01:31,322 --> 00:01:32,527
and some learn to cross

50
00:01:32,547 --> 00:01:34,677
the stars without the gates.

51
00:01:34,697 --> 00:01:35,747
One day, a ship

52
00:01:35,767 --> 00:01:37,982
from far away reaches Earth,

53
00:01:38,002 --> 00:01:39,257
and the man who greets them

54
00:01:39,277 --> 00:01:40,782
is Amos Burton,

55
00:01:40,802 --> 00:01:43,600
still here, still looking after his people.

56
00:01:44,314 --> 00:01:46,299
That's the whole story of The Expanse:

57
00:01:46,319 --> 00:01:47,997
a drive, a war,

58
00:01:48,017 --> 00:01:50,219
a Ring, a thousand worlds,

59
00:01:50,239 --> 00:01:52,294
and the people who held them together.

60
00:01:52,314 --> 00:01:53,794
Thanks for watching.

61
00:01:53,814 --> 00:01:54,664
The end.

